  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Byskogsbruk (RECOFTC) 2010-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Forestry (RECOFTC) 2010-2015 - RECOFTC 2010-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centrum f&#xf6;r skogar och m&#xe4;nniskor (RECOFTC) &#xe4;r en regional             organisation som arbetar med samh&#xe4;lls-/kommunalt (commnunity)         skogsbruk i Asien. RECOFTCs verksamhet &#xe4;r huvudsakligen inriktad p&#xe5;   att fr&#xe4;mja skogar och folkens r&#xe4;ttigheter till skogarna. Detta g&#xf6;rs   genom utbildning, r&#xe5;dgivning, forskning, publikationer osv.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Center for forests and people (RECOFTC) is a regional             organisation working with commnunity forestry in Asia. Their          activities is mainly directed at promoting community forests and      peoples rights to the forests. This is done by training, advise,      research, publications etc.</narrative>
  </description>
